One bounded cycle per queue run for exactly two pinned deployments/guests: verified active lease of metal0's runner/operator,
authenticated original guest running, reserve policy Ready, <= 8 renewals/app, 4 h TTL, durable intent before any relay POST
(ambiguous intent stops for reconcile, never re-signs), no claims, no operator ETH, no key/signature output; defers to and
stops after a control that adopted both original guests and renewed them itself. Production I/O = root's renew-protected-2331
logic with the unchanged lease client. Tests 8/8 on the actual cycle/entry/loop with fakes and a fake clock.
